Frontend (Vite) — copy this file as frontend/.env.local and fill in real values
DO NOT commit .env.local to git

Supabase project URL (found in Supabase Dashboard > Settings > API)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co

Supabase anon/public key (found in Supabase Dashboard > Settings > API)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here

WhatsApp number for customer contact (format: 62xxxxxxxxxx)
VITE_WA_NUMBER=62xxxxxxxxxx

Sentry DSN for error tracking (optional, leave empty to disable)
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=

Supabase Edge Function base URL (leave empty to use same-origin /api proxy)
Only set this if using a custom functions domain
VITE_SUPABASE_FUNCTIONS_URL=

--- Build-time only (Vercel/CI private env vars, do NOT use VITE_ prefix) ---
SENTRY_ORG=your-sentry-org
SENTRY_PROJECT=your-sentry-project
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=your-sentry-auth-token
